          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "6. In this regard, an application is to be submitted within a period of thirty days from the date of receipt of the notice."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "963153bbb5f346fc9b867ad1cd7f2b45_13",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Since the appeal has been preferred after the expiry of the thirty days, the second respondent- Designated Officer rejected the same and thus there is no infirmity."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "1bb25d2cd10445c1a7ec8ec0a7c4ef8b_14",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Hence, the present writ petition is to be rejected.\n7. Section 46 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 contemplates 'Functions of Food Analyst'.\n"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "96207ac2ab9f4ab693fa1f0076ac7e4c_15",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Under Sub Section (3) to Section 46 of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006, the Food Analyst has https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis submitted his Report stating that that the food product manufactured by the petitioner-Company is unsafe."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "0ed9bcb254d2454ca434d1ecbea9ab84_16",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "8. The petitioner-Company preferred an appeal under Section 46(4) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 along with the request to send the samples to the Referral Lab for further Report."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bf94a0bd4e0949819f4721e5affd3f3a_17",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "It is the statutory opportunity contemplated to an aggrieved person to have second lab examination, which need not be denied merely on the ground that an application was submitted beyond the period of thirty days."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f416481b0cc140f6a6a0ea5d57699b10_18",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the present case, the delay occurred on account of COVID 19 and therefore, the petitioner cannot be faulted."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "fa46015379dc46e8abddb7ecc929a88b_19",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "STA"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n9. Section 46(4) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 stipulates that \"an appeal against the report of Food Analyst shall lie before the Designated Officer who shall, if he so decides, refer the matter to the Referral Food Laboratory"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "68251d49c1e447c2bc16df547fffd3d7_20",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "In the present case, the notice dated 27.02.2020 states that the Referral Lab is the Central Government Lab to which the samples are to https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis be sent for further analysis."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "b13840cb277140938865b8e956a9726c_21",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "11. In view of the facts and circumstances, the reasons stated in the impugned order to reject the claim of the writ petitioner to have further opportunity to test the product through Referral Laboratory is neither candid nor convincing, bu"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "f3f7a47f8ecc40f1bce4c9330b6aecf6_22",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "\n12. It is made clear that even to send the samples to the Referral Lab, the Authority is empowered to exercise its discretion."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "bf1b2323f9554054b82aa90507ba1b2d_23",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Section 46(4) of the Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006 unambiguously stipulates that the Designated Officer who shall, if he so decides, refer the matter to the Referral Food Laboratory."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "e4fbfa058ea24676ac362a0d98225660_24",
        "summary_section": "ANALYSIS",
        "labels": [
          "ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:ANALYSIS"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Therefore, it is not an absolute right of an aggrieved person to send the samples to the Referral Food Laboratory contemplated."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "3763b79c83ce4de78f96f760e392a226_25",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "Test is to be taken by the Designated Officer for the purpose of sending the samples to the Referral Laboratory i.e., the Central Government Laboratory,\nSree Annaporna Foods vs The Commissioner Of Food Safety on 2 January, 2024 Indian Kanoo"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "d619f8e5a9574d8cbb8bcc87274f5d46_26",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "13. Therefore, the second respondent-Designated Officer shall take a decision whether the samples secured from the petitioner-Company https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis necessarily have to be sent for further analysis to the Referral Laborator"
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "cb9b09a0e8784baa8bf0e1a73b547fa7_27",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "The said decision is directed to be taken by the second respondent-Designated Officer, within a period of two weeks from the date of receipt of a copy of this order."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "205e19fb6b1a4f28b7acdf771fdffe07_28",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
        "reasons": [
          "forbidden_section:decision",
          "forbidden_labels:RPC",
          "suspicious_label:rpc"
        ],
        "matched_phrases": [],
        "text_preview": "If the decision is taken to send the samples collected from the petitioner-Company to the Referral Lab, then it is to be sent to the Referral Laboratory without causing any undue delay."
      },
      {
        "annotation_id": "92ab1f04c482460ab292997633ee66c8_29",
        "summary_section": "decision",
        "labels": [
          "RPC"
        ],
